      "decision": "Choose, revise or reject an intervention only after applying the model to the stated actor, unit, alternatives and horizon.",
      "limits": "An operating/cash divergence is a diagnostic, not a verdict of strength or distress. Explain its sources, duration, commitments and available liquidity.",
      "calibration": "An operating/cash divergence is a diagnostic, not a verdict of strength or distress. Explain its sources, duration, commitments and available liquidity.",
      "origin": "Full user-supplied 136-model source, received September 9, 2026. Original wording preserved for provenance; current calibration governs application.",
      "applications": [
