      "name": "Operating and Non-Operating Earnings",
      "aliases": [
        "Hedge the Displacement",
        "Net Income Has Two Engines",
        "Read the Sign of the Distortion (Two Engines, Both Ways)"
      ],
      "definition": "Separate operating performance from investment marks and other non-operating effects, reconciling positive and negative distortions to reported results.",
      "keyQuestion": "How much of the bottom line is the operating engine — and how much is a mark that can reverse?",
      "form": "diagnostic",
