      ],
      "definition": "Technology substitution depends on the task, customer and workflow segment, so aggregate company labels can conceal opposing effects.",
      "keyQuestion": "Which segment inside this total has gone negative, and which agent behaviour explains it?",
      "form": "causal-hypothesis",
