      "aliases": [
        "Get Big Fast, Monetize Later vs Paid From Day One",
        "The Free User Is a Cost"
      ],
      "definition": "A free user creates costs and potential future value; evaluate acquisition, conversion, learning and network benefits against actual delivery expense.",
